title: "Prospect Actuary: fantasy football prospect grades and trade values built with actuarial methods"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Prospect Actuary"
    website: "https://kylemschyma.github.io/prospect-actuary/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KyleMSchyma/prospect-actuary"
url: "https://kylemschyma.github.io/prospect-actuary/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - fantasy football
  - NFL draft prospects
  - dynasty trade values
  - actuarial science
  - credibility theory
  - predictive analytics
abstract: >-
  Letter grades and tier probabilities for NFL QB, RB, WR and TE prospects (pre-draft, post-draft and 2027 class),
  and redraft and dynasty trade values on an additive 100,000-point scale, refreshed weekly. Built with actuarial
  methods (credibility blending, survival and aging, present value). Research code:
  https://github.com/KyleMSchyma/Football. Third-party source data (nflverse, CollegeFootballData.com, Dynasty Daddy,
  DynastyProcess, Sleeper) keeps its own terms.
